      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 999,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 999,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "Legend:\n  Blue solid = critical sync path (redirect: client → CDN → LB → API → cache/db)\n  Pink = cache layer (Redis)\n  Blue rect = persistent storage (DB)\n  Orange dashed = async / fire-and-forget (click events to Kafka, CDC, blocklist async rescan)\n  Yellow = stateful coordinators (Zookeeper counter, Kafka, async consumers)\n  Capacity at peak: ~30 K reads/sec, ~40 writes/sec; working set ~80 GB; total storage ~1 TB.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 100,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Legend:\n  Blue solid = critical sync path (redirect: client → CDN → LB → API → cache/db)\n  Pink = cache layer (Redis)\n  Blue rect = persistent storage (DB)\n  Orange dashed = async / fire-and-forget (click events to Kafka, CDC, blocklist async rescan)\n  Yellow = stateful coordinators (Zookeeper counter, Kafka, async consumers)\n  Capacity at peak: ~30 K reads/sec, ~40 writes/sec; working set ~80 GB; total storage ~1 TB.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
